# Using Articulate Virtual Laboratories in Teaching Energy Conversion at the U.S. Naval Academy.

**Authors:** Wu, C.

## Abstract
The Mechanical Engineering Department at the U.S. Naval Academy is currently evaluating a new teaching method which uses computer software. Utilizing the thermodynamic-based software CyclePad, Intelligent Computer Aided Instruction is incorporated in an advanced energy conversion course for Mechanical Engineering students. The CyclePad software enhances lectures and aids students in visualization and design. (Author)

